{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101301","id":2266735451,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6HG6Nb","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101301","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101301.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101301.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101301","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101301/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101301/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101301/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a450a5af8a3e71f6fa85e209e681697e60a9c858","number":101301,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add a python test to check string literals for non-ascii characters.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I propose that all strings that contain non-ascii characters must henceforth be marked as such (e.g. u8\"...\"), to catch accidental mistakes in string literals early. The check is performed by the static analyzer and takes only a few seconds: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/12676255818/job/35329065210?pr=101301\r\n\r\nThrough this test, I found one zero-width space in a string literal in `locales.h` (and another through explicit search in `CHANGELOG.md`.\r\n\r\nOther found instances were expected and could be safely marked as u8 literals.\r\n\r\nThis PR helps address https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100641.\r\nA better solution would be to set [-fexec-charset](https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/cpp-oel-zos/2.0?topic=options-fexec-charset) to ASCII only, but unfortunately that does not seem to be supported right now.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXN